</div></section>
<div class="rv-tools"><section class="pl-card rv-breakdown" aria-labelledby="rating-breakdown-heading"><h3 id="rating-breakdown-heading"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Rating breakdown</h3><p>Every rating contributes equally to the overview.</p><div class="rv-bars"><?php for ($star = 5; $star >= 1; $star--): ?><div class="rv-bar-row"><span><?= $star ?> <i class="bi bi-star-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><progress max="<?= max(1, $reviews['count']) ?>" value="<?= $reviews['buckets'][$star] ?>" aria-label="<?= $star ?> stars: <?= $reviews['buckets'][$star] ?> of <?= $reviews['count'] ?> reviews"></progress><strong><?= $reviews['buckets'][$star] ?></strong></div><?php endfor ?></div></section>
<section class="pl-card rv-contribute" aria-labelledby="review-contribute-heading"><h3 id="review-contribute-heading"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square" aria-hidden="true"></i> Your experience matters</h3><p>What works well? What could feel simpler? Focus on your experience using the application.</p><ul><li><i class="bi bi-check2" aria-hidden="true"></i> Useful feedback includes specific examples.</li><li><i class="bi bi-check2" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ratings describe app experience, not prediction results.</li></ul><details id="review-draft"><summary>Try writing a review <span>Local draft</span></summary><p class="rv-note">Saved only in this browser tab. Nothing is submitted or published. Live reviews will require a verified email and human approval.</p><form data-review-draft><fieldset disabled data-draft-fields><legend class="sr-only">Local review draft</legend><label>Your rating<select name="rating" required><option value="">Select a rating</option><?php for ($star = 5; $star >= 1; $star--): ?><option value="<?= $star ?>"><?= $star ?> <?= $star === 1 ? 'star' : 'stars' ?></option><?php endfor ?></select></label><label>Review title<input name="title" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Sum up your experience"></label><label>Your review<textarea name="body" required minlength="20" maxlength="2000" rows="3" placeholder="What did you find useful or difficult?" aria-describedby="review-body-help"></textarea></label><small id="review-body-help">20&ndash;2,000 characters. Keep personal information out of your review.</small><div class="rv-draft-actions"><button class="rv-button rv-primary" type="submit" hidden data-draft-save>Save local draft</button><button class="rv-button" type="button" hidden data-draft-clear>Clear draft</button></div></fieldset><p class="rv-note" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-draft-status></p><noscript><p class="rv-note">Enable JavaScript to save a local draft.</p></noscript></form></details></section></div>
<section aria-labelledby="community-reviews-heading"><div class="pl-section-head rv-list-heading"><div><h3 id="community-reviews-heading">Community reviews</h3><p>A mix of experiences and ideas for improvement.</p></div><form class="pl-filters rv-filters" method="get" action="/reviews" data-review-filters><label>Rating<select name="rating"><option value="all">All ratings</option><?php for ($star = 5; $star >= 1; $star--): ?><option value="<?= $star ?>" <?= $reviews['rating'] === (string) $star ? 'selected' : '' ?>><?= $star ?> <?= $star === 1 ? 'star' : 'stars' ?></option><?php endfor ?></select></label><label>Sort<select name="sort"><?php foreach (['newest' => 'Newest first', 'highest' => 'Highest rated', 'lowest' => 'Lowest rated'] as $value => $label): ?><option value="<?= e($value) ?>" <?= $reviews['sort'] === $value ? 'selected' : '' ?>><?= e($label) ?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><button type="submit" class="rv-button rv-apply">Apply</button></form></div>
<div class="rv-review-grid"><?php foreach ($reviews['rows'] as $review): ?><article class="pl-card rv-review" aria-labelledby="<?= e($review['id']) ?>-title"><header><div class="rv-author"><span class="rv-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><?= e(substr($review['name'], 0, 1)) ?></span><div><strong><?= e($review['name']) ?></strong><span>Demo reviewer</span></div></div><time datetime="<?= e($review['date']) ?>"><?= e($date($review['date'])) ?></time></header><div class="rv-stars" role="img" aria-label="<?= $review['rating'] ?> out of 5 stars"><?php for ($star = 1; $star <= 5; $star++): ?><i class="bi bi-star<?= $star <= $review['rating'] ? '-fill' : '' ?>" aria-hidden="true"></i><?php endfor ?><span aria-hidden="true"><?= $review['rating'] ?>/5</span></div><h4 id="<?= e($review['id']) ?>-title"><?= e($review['title']) ?></h4><p><?= e($review['body']) ?></p></article><?php endforeach ?><?php if (!$reviews['rows']): ?><div class="pl-card rv-empty"><i class="bi bi-chat-square-text" aria-hidden="true"></i><h4>No reviews match this rating</h4><p>Try a different rating to explore the demo feedback.</p><a href="/reviews#community-reviews-heading">Reset filters &rarr;</a></div><?php endif ?></div>
<div class="rv-list-footer"><span>Showing <?= $reviews['total'] ? ($reviews['page'] - 1) * $reviews['pageSize'] + 1 : 0 ?>&ndash;<?= min($reviews['page'] * $reviews['pageSize'], $reviews['total']) ?> of <?= $reviews['total'] ?> reviews</span><nav aria-label="Review pages"><?php if ($reviews['page'] > 1): ?><a href="<?= e($link($reviews['page'] - 1)) ?>">&larr; Previous</a><?php endif ?><span>Page <?= $reviews['page'] ?> of <?= $reviews['pages'] ?></span><?php if ($reviews['page'] < $reviews['pages']): ?><a href="<?= e($link($reviews['page'] + 1)) ?>">Next &rarr;</a><?php endif ?></nav></div></section>
<p class="rv-note">Sample feedback only &middot; Reviews do not measure prediction accuracy or financial performance.</p>
